{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For <strong>Mahsa</strong>. For every woman who was never allowed to speak.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>I Don't Want To Be A Good Woman</strong>&quot; is an interactive documentary and walking simulator that brings you face-to-face with the realities of women living in Iran under systemic oppression. Conceived as a digital, open-air museum, this experience invites you to walk through memories, testimonies, and stark realities. Live through stories that we have heard, gathered, or lived ourselves as anonymous developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game; it is a dedicated space to witness, to remember, and to stand in solidarity with an ongoing struggle for basic human rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interactive Museum of Resilience:</strong> Explore minimalist, atmospheric environments filled with real-world context, dark facts, and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Reality:</strong> Gain a harrowing but necessary perspective on the daily realities of growing up under strict religious laws and the systemic discrimination faced by women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/235fe3113ac17acb65ef1b145b639f88.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/235fe3113ac17acb65ef1b145b639f88.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/235fe3113ac17acb65ef1b145b639f88.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The &quot;Right&quot; Path:</strong> Navigate the oppressive expectations and forced paths placed upon women, and learn what it means to resist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/cc8223cb8cc5cdb93d3ffbb96b07c154.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/cc8223cb8cc5cdb93d3ffbb96b07c154.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/cc8223cb8cc5cdb93d3ffbb96b07c154.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amplify Silenced Voices:</strong> By playing, witnessing, and sharing these gathered experiences, you help ensure these acts of defiance and the fight for freedom are not forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/452b991dd3da80ab37615cd6b60b7856.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/452b991dd3da80ab37615cd6b60b7856.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/452b991dd3da80ab37615cd6b60b7856.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779700?t=1773575550","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/0213c50d2a510ad38b1e054a1064282b7b241089/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773575550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/55049d3e6e1ff420c37dfa5b4de70582221fa9c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773575550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/55049d3e6e1ff420c37dfa5b4de70582221fa9c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773575550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This experience explores real-life challenges faced by women in Iran under Islamic law, including gender-based discrimination, restricted bodily autonomy, and limitations on freedom of expression. Themes such as forced hijab, lack of reproductive rights, and state violence are presented through a narrative lens. While the game contains no explicit imagery, it does involve mature social and political themes.\r\n\r\nThe game depicts discriminatory behavior toward women by state and religious systems from the perspective of a victim. These portrayals are not meant to promote hate or disparagement, but to raise awareness of real-world issues through an empathetic and objective narrative."},"demos":[{"appid":4064120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>For <strong>Mahsa</strong>. For every woman who was never allowed to speak.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>I Don't Want To Be A Good Woman</strong>&quot; is an interactive documentary and walking simulator that brings you face-to-face with the realities of women living in Iran under systemic oppression. Conceived as a digital, open-air museum, this experience invites you to walk through memories, testimonies, and stark realities. Live through stories that we have heard, gathered, or lived ourselves as anonymous developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/905010cf1420691302e4f2d1abd3d126.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game; it is a dedicated space to witness, to remember, and to stand in solidarity with an ongoing struggle for basic human rights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Interactive Museum of Resilience:</strong> Explore minimalist, atmospheric environments filled with real-world context, dark facts, and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.webm?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/4819cdfe73cf64f38bd07a04da68e0f9.mp4?t=1773575550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Reality:</strong> Gain a harrowing but necessary perspective on the daily realities of growing up under strict religious laws and the systemic discrimination faced by women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/235fe3113ac17acb65ef1b145b639f88.poster.avif?t=1773575550\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779700/extras/235fe3113ac17acb65ef1b145b639f88.w